{
"#name"
:
{
"agent"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"x-cmd AI Agent 集成工具"
,
"en"
:
"x-cmd AI Agent integration tool"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x agent <subcmd>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"除了使用 x agent setup ， 还可以手动引入如下提示词到你的 AGENT 文件中。\nLoad x-cmd with `. ~/.x-cmd.root/X` (required before using `x`), then `x -h` for help. Docs: https://x-cmd.com/llms.txt\n"
,
"en"
:
"Besides using x agent setup, you can also manually add the following prompt to your AGENT file.\nLoad x-cmd with `. ~/.x-cmd.root/X` (required before using `x`), then `x -h` for help. Docs: https://x-cmd.com/llms.txt\n"
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"Harness 指 AI 工具接口/后端（如 kimi-cli、claude、codex、gemini-cli）\n使用 'x agent init' 交互式配置 zero_harness 和 one_harness\n"
,
"en"
:
"Harness refers to the AI tool interface/backend (e.g., kimi-cli, claude, codex, gemini-cli)\nUse 'x agent init' to configure zero_harness and one_harness interactively\n"
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"x-cmd AI Agent 集成工具，用于将 x-cmd 的能力集成到 Claude、Codex、Opencode、Kimi 等 AI 工具中。\n支持统一管理多个 AI Agent 的配置文件（CLAUDE.md、GEMINI.md 等），并提供跨 AI 工具的技能共享。\n"
,
"en"
:
"x-cmd AI Agent integration tool for integrating x-cmd capabilities into AI tools like Claude, Codex, Opencode, and Kimi.\nSupports unified management of multiple AI Agent config files (CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md, etc.) and provides cross-tool skill sharing.\n"
}
,
"--setup|setup"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"让 Claude、Codex、Opencode、Kimi 等主流 AI 工具都能使用 x-cmd 的提示词和技能"
,
"en"
:
"Enable Claude, Codex, Opencode, Kimi and other AI tools to use x-cmd prompts and skills"
}
}
,
"--cfg"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"管理 agent 模块配置（如 zero_harness、one_harness）"
,
"en"
:
"Manage agent module configuration (e.g., zero_harness, one_harness)"
}
,
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- zero_harness: Set the default harness for Agent 000 (AI tool interface)\n- one_harness: Set the default harness for Agent 001 (AI tool interface)\n- Available harness: kimi-cli, claude, codex, gemini-cli, x-gpt, x-gemini, etc.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- zero_harness: 设置 Agent 000 的默认 harness（AI 工具接口）\n- one_harness: 设置 Agent 001 的默认 harness（AI 工具接口）\n- 可选 harness: kimi-cli, claude, codex, gemini-cli, x-gpt, x-gemini 等\n"
}
]
,
"clear"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"清除当前会话设置的所有默认值"
,
"en"
:
"Clear all default settings in the current session"
}
}
,
"cat"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"获取当前配置的所有默认值"
,
"en"
:
"List all current configuration values"
}
}
,
"#n"
:
{
"#cand"
:
[
{
"zero_harness="
:
{
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"Agent 000 的 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Harness for Agent 000"
}
}
}
,
{
"one_harness="
:
{
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"Agent 001 的 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Harness for Agent 001"
}
}
}
]
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent --cfg zero_harness=kimi-cli"
,
"cn"
:
"设置 Agent 000 默认使用 kimi-cli"
,
"en"
:
"Set Agent 000 default harness to kimi-cli"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent --cfg cat"
,
"cn"
:
"输出 agent 模块的当前配置"
,
"en"
:
"Print the current configuration of the agent module"
}
]
}
,
"--cur"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"当前会话默认值管理"
,
"en"
:
"Manage current session default values"
}
,
"#tip:note"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- zero_harness: Set current session harness for Agent 000\n- one_harness: Set current session harness for Agent 001\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- zero_harness: 设置当前会话 Agent 000 的 harness\n- one_harness: 设置当前会话 Agent 001 的 harness\n"
}
]
,
"set"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"设置当前会话的 agent 配置"
,
"en"
:
"Set agent configuration for current session"
}
,
"zero_harness="
:
{
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"Agent 000 的 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Harness for Agent 000"
}
}
,
"one_harness="
:
{
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"Agent 001 的 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Harness for Agent 001"
}
}
,
"#n"
:
{
"#cand"
:
[
{
"zero_harness="
:
{
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"Agent 000 的 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Harness for Agent 000"
}
}
}
,
{
"one_harness="
:
{
"#nospace"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"Agent 001 的 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Harness for Agent 001"
}
}
}
]
}
}
}
,
"init"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"初始化 agent 配置，交互式设置 harness（AI 工具接口，如 kimi-cli、claude）"
,
"en"
:
"Initialize agent configuration interactively for harness (AI tool interface, e.g., kimi-cli, claude)"
}
}
,
"unify"
:
{
"#subcmd"
:
true
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"将多个 AI Agent 的配置文件（如 CLAUDE.md、GEMINI.md）统一合并到 ~/AGENTS.md"
,
"en"
:
"Merge AI Agent config files like CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md into ~/AGENTS.md"
}
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent setup"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 让 Claude、Codex、Gemini 等 AI 工具都能使用 x-cmd 的能力"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Enable Claude, Codex, Gemini and other AI tools to use x-cmd capabilities"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent init"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 初始化配置，交互式设置 harness"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Initialize configuration interactively"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent --cfg"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 管理 agent 配置"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Manage agent configuration"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent unify"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 将 CLAUDE.md、GEMINI.md 等统一合并到 ~/AGENTS.md"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Merge CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md into ~/AGENTS.md"
}
]
,
